%% Sequence diagram: one run of the CUDA DE, version 2 (src/cuda/de_cuda_v2.cu)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User / run_all.py
    participant H as Host (main, CPU)
    participant G as GPU (global memory)
    participant KP as kernel P
    participant KM as kernel MCER
    participant KA as kernel argmin

    U->>H: de_cuda_v2 function D N seed file.csv
    H->>H: check arguments, T = --threads or automatic (32 or 64)
    H->>H: o = make_shift(f, D) (same shift as the sequential DE)
    H->>G: cudaFree(0), cudaMalloc (pop A/B, fit A/B, indices, cuRAND states)
    H->>G: cudaMemcpyToSymbol(c_shift ← o)
    Note over H,G: start timer (cudaEventRecord e0)
    H->>G: k_init_rng, k_init_pop<<<N, T>>>, k_eval_pop<<<N, T>>>
    Note over H: fe = N
    loop while fe < 10⁴·D (n = min(N, 10⁴·D − fe))
        H->>KP: k_P (one thread per individual)
        KP->>G: r1, r2, r3, jrand (int4) for each i
        H->>KM: k_MCER<<<N, T>>> (one block per individual, one thread per gene)
        KM->>KM: mutation + crossover → trial in shared memory
        KM->>KM: f(trial) by tree reduction (log₂ T steps)
        KM->>G: replacement: winner written to pop_out
        H->>H: swap pop_in ↔ pop_out (pointers), fe += n
    end
    H->>KA: k_argmin<<<1, 512>>>
    KA->>G: best individual (value + index)
    G-->>H: struct Best (16 bytes)
    Note over H,G: stop timer (cudaEventRecord e1)
    G-->>H: copy population and fitness (untimed)
    H->>H: checks: bounds, finite values, budget, GPU argmin = CPU min, GPU f = CPU evaluate()
    H->>U: result line + CSV row (algo,func,D,N,seed,best_error,time_s,FE)
